 Set-top-box, 5G radios, and JioFi hotspots. In addition, it develops JioFrames, an AI-powered wearable smart-glasses product; and Jio Set-top-box; and consumer applications, including MyJio, JioMart, JioFinance, JioGate, JioMeet, JioAirFiber, JioCDN, and JioChat, along with the HelloJio voice assistant and JioAds advertising platform. Further, it develops proprietary operating systems, including JioBharat OS, JioTele OS, and JioBrain. The company develops and provides JioRemote, JioExtender, routers, and USB cameras. Additionally, it offers JioBusiness services, JioPC, JioCloud infrastructure, JioCX communications platform, JioRaksha cybersecurity services, and the JioThings IoT platform, along with JioAttendance, Jio Hospitality solution (JHES), and JioRooms. It also provides satellite-based communication and international connectivity services. The company serves consumers, government, MSMEs, large enterprises, and startups. Jio Platforms Limited was founded in 2016 and is based in Navi Mumbai, India. Jio Platforms Limited operates as a subsidiary of Reliance Industries Limited.","employees":28163,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795440532},"analyst":{"key":null,"mean":null,"n":3,"tMean":1430,"tHigh":1515,"tLow":1340,"tMed":1435,"currency":"INR","asOf":1795440532,"trend":{"strongBuy":2,"buy":1,"hold":0,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}},"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795440532,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Jio Platforms\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Mukesh Ambani’s next big bets for Reliance","s":"Business Today","d":1795428611,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Mukesh Ambani’s long game is paying off","s":"Business Today","d":1795425512,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Jio Platforms Limited valuation leaves little target upside","s":"Multibagg AI","d":1795338037,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPMjl0XzFVMHZFT3hkUURfRUZMQzJPV0Y3czhFd0NmdlNBT3Q4